  "result": "The fix is in `src/server/services/notification-service.ts`: `notify()` now skips any recipient who is the event's actor, so a user who comments on an issue they're assigned to no longer gets a \"New comment\" notification.\n\nThe cause was that `notify()` fanned out to every recipient without checking `payload.actorId`. The `comment.created` subscriber builds its watcher list from the issue's author and assignee, so the commenter was included whenever they were one of those. The existing test \"does not notify the actor about their own action\" already expected this check, so it would have been failing.",
